VoltSet SM8850 patch
====================

This project contains a modified version of the backend script shipped with
VoltSet (https://github.com/rfj53005-gif/VoltSet), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications (2026-11):
  * added a private-mount-namespace shim so qcom_voltage_adj is reachable on
    devices whose init does not mount debugfs
  * added last-set bookkeeping, boot replay hook, drift repair, write retries
    and on-device diagnostics to the backend script

